=2 Walkthrough
* Solo mission
* Speak with the {p:Quartermaster} in front of the Tavern, if you're facing the {z:West Sarutabaruta} exit arch, he'll be behind you across the bridge from the tents.
* He will provide different players with different types of 'supplies' to bring. The following are possible options:

